flowchart TD
    A[main.py Entry] --> B[Logging + Imports]
    B --> C[EDIATHSystem Init]
    C --> D[Orchestrator Config Load]
    D --> E[Async initialize]

    subgraph INIT_SEQ [Initialization Sequence]
        E --> E1[Validate Deps]
        E1 --> E2[Rate Limiter]
        E2 --> E3[Task Queue Manager<br/>AI/Automation/Learning Queues]
        E3 --> E4[Orchestrator Init]
        E4 --> E5[LLM Engine<br/>CRITICAL - ollama/gguf]
        E5 --> E6[Executor + File Manager]
        E6 --> E7[Audio: Speaker/Wakeword/Listener]
        E7 --> E8[Vision Engine Optional]
        E8 --> E9[System READY]
    end

    E9 --> F[Main Modes]
    F -->|UI Mode| G[Kivy App + DashboardScreen]
    F -->|Backend Mode| H[Voice Loop + Autonomous Loops]
